@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@
+The payload is 256 KiB whose byte differences at distance 4 compress well,
+so that the archive stays small, generated by this small python program:
+
+open('delta_payload.bin', 'wb').write(
+    bytes((i * i + (i >> 8)) & 0xff for i in range(256 * 1024)))
